          },
          "description": "The BrainBots are out of the classroom and heading back in time to learn as much as they can about dinosaurs. In this card Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs explore Ankylosaurus! They’ll investigate the mosaic like plates that encased their back, see how they differed to Stegosaurus and find out what weighed more - an Ankylosaurus or a rhino!\n\nTest your knowledge at the end of the card to see how many BrainBank facts you can remember about these amazing creatures. \n"
